  "description": "The RetroVolt Max is a high-performance retro electric bike built for riders who demand more power, longer range, and greater comfort. Combining a 2000W peak motor, dual battery system, and full suspension, it delivers an exciting ride for daily commuting, weekend cruising, and off-road adventures.\nPowered by a 52V 20Ah*2 dual battery system, the RetroVolt Max offers up to 150 miles of range on a single charge. The 2000W peak motor delivers rapid acceleration and powerful hill-climbing performance, while 20×4-inch fat tires, full suspension, and hydraulic disc brakes provide confidence and control across city streets, gravel roads, and rugged terrain.\nDesigned for everyday reliability, the RetroVolt Max features UL 2271 certified batteries and a UL 2849 certified electrical system, along with a quick-release removable battery for convenient charging at home or on the go. A smart color display, integrated LED lighting, and SHIMANO 7-speed drivetrain complete the premium riding experience.\nWhether you're commuting to work, exploring scenic backroads, or enjoying weekend adventures, the RetroVolt Max delivers the perfect balance of power, comfort, and long-range freedom.",
